@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title Rust arena policy + Node engine bridge — synthetic source contract
left to right direction

component "apps/arena/src/main.rs\nRust CLI / one synthetic window" as MAIN <<app>>
component "apps/arena/src/lib.rs\nRust typed DTO / features / argmax\ncanonical tie-break / process driver" as POLICY <<app>>
component "training_native\nscore_synthetic_f64\ndirect Rust library call" as SCORER <<app>>
component "engine/worker.ts + protocol.ts\nfixed Node --import tsx / cwd apps/arena\narena-engine-v1 / open then settle" as BRIDGE <<host>>
component "engine/fixture.ts\nreconstruct tiny-v1 for each request\nown king e1 / enemy king e8 / bank=3" as FIXTURE <<app>>
component "engine/observation.ts\n64 ordered fog-safe cells\nown resources only" as OBS <<app>>
component "engine/admission.ts\nselected white action / black empty pass\natomic admission + bank settlement" as ADMISSION <<app>>
component "packages/starchess-core\nunchanged native rules\naddScAction / endScTurn / income" as NATIVE <<app>>
component "Rust synthetic report\nmilestone=burn-flex-compat-v1\nscope=synthetic / assurance=NON_ADMITTED\nmodelArtifact=null / fullRunner=false" as RESULT <<app>>
component "Closed failure\nno policy or engine substitute" as FAILURE <<error>>

MAIN ARROW_MAIN POLICY : start fixed compatibility invocation
POLICY ARROW_MAIN BRIDGE : one-shot open(tiny-v1)\nthen one-shot settle(selected action)
BRIDGE ARROW_MAIN FIXTURE : reconstruct on both calls\nno caller snapshot or bank
FIXTURE ARROW_MAIN NATIVE : fixed native engine state
BRIDGE ARROW_MAIN OBS : project reconstructed open state
OBS ARROW_MAIN NATIVE : native visibility / own resources
OBS ARROW_MAIN BRIDGE : limited observation DTO only
BRIDGE ARROW_MAIN POLICY : exact protocol / id / op\nsettle observation equals open
POLICY ARROW_MAIN SCORER : king-to-d1 / king-to-f1\nrows=[file,rank,0 x 416]
SCORER ARROW_MAIN POLICY : finite ordered f64 scores\ncanonical maximum
BRIDGE ARROW_MAIN ADMISSION : settle only / closed classical action\nwhite e1 to d1 or f1 / black pass
ADMISSION ARROW_MAIN NATIVE : same-open-state atomic pair\nnative income / bank reapplication
ADMISSION ARROW_MAIN BRIDGE : SCFEN / bank / raw engine results\nreport-only after action selection
POLICY ARROW_MAIN RESULT : validated settlement report\ntruth details never feed scoring
POLICY ARROW_ERROR FAILURE : invalid envelope / DTO mismatch\n30 s total includes 3 s reap reserve
BRIDGE ARROW_ERROR FAILURE : bounded stream or child failure\nno shell / eval / auto-install
ADMISSION ARROW_ERROR FAILURE : native admission or settlement failure

note bottom of OBS
  Only visible board cells and the player's own
  resources cross the observation boundary,
  because private state would taint the proof.
  Hidden cells keep their positions while
  concealing enemy contents.
end note

note bottom of ADMISSION
  Stage both seats against the same open state,
  because sequential mutation would change
  simultaneous admission semantics. Keep bank
  state separate from the native snapshot and
  apply income only at native grant boundaries.
end note

note bottom of BRIDGE
  Each one-shot request reconstructs the same
  fixture rather than accepting caller state.
  This confines the bridge to compatibility
  checks and cannot establish a persistent
  match runner or a general replay protocol.
end note

note bottom of POLICY
  The policy receives only the limited
  observation before selecting an action, since
  full engine state would cross the boundary.
  Native settlement details become report data
  after selection and never feed the scorer.
end note

legend bottom
  Source contract; see the plan for matched-source receipts.
  Node stdin 64 KiB / stdout 1 MiB / stderr 64 KiB.
  Total 30 s includes 3 s reap; clear NODE_OPTIONS.
  Two reconstructed calls, not a stateful match runner.
  No R4 feature encoder, learned policy or full match.
  Full replacement deferred; legacy deletion stays last.
endlegend
@enduml
